WEBVTT

00:17:27.834 --> 00:17:31.805
yang dianggap oleh NAVA

00:17:31.805 --> 00:17:36.681
sebagai bendera kota 
terburuk di Amerika Utara.

00:17:36.681 --> 00:17:37.920
[Bangga Menjadi Pocatello]

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:40.920
(Tertawa)

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:43.920
(Tepuk Tangan)

00:17:44.111 --> 00:17:46.247
Ya.

00:17:46.247 --> 00:17:49.067
Ada simbol merek perdagangan padanya.

00:17:49.067 --> 00:17:51.458
(Tertawa)

00:17:51.458 --> 00:17:53.128
Melihatnya saja sudah menyakitkan.

00:17:53.128 --> 00:17:53.840
(Tertawa)

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.250
Terima kasih banyak karena
sudah mendengarkan.

00:17:56.320 --> 00:18:01.628
(Tepuk Tangan)
